unknown_view_consumer
---------------------

l1: $ nd (hyp (P y)) (P y) $ by ax []
l2: $ nd (hyp (P y)) (E. x (P x)) $ by ex_intro [l1]
l3: $ nd (hyp (P y)) ?c $ by or_l [l2]
l4: $ nd (hyp (E. x (P x))) ((E. x (P x)) \/ Q u) $ by ex_elim [#1, l3]

unknown_view_context
--------------------

l1: $ nd ?G1 (P u /\ Q u) $ by all_elim_w [#1]
l2: $ nd (hyp a) (P u /\ Q u) $ by reit [l1]
